| test measure | value |
|---|---:|
| summed-pixel Bernoulli NLL | 380.600250244 |
| reconstruction pixel MSE | 0.148934076 |
| fitting-mean pixel MSE | 0.048548290 |
| discriminator loss | 1.484207749 |
| encoder adversarial loss | 0.657211900 |
Fresh all-group restore / prior-independent reconstruction / code-only decoding / repeat / batch / immutable checks pass.
