> Twenty explicit prior draws, no quality filtering

The saved generation bank contains20 independent four-dimensional standard-normal vectors
from seed3571. Each vector alone enters the selected G decoder. The display shows sigmoid
probabilities with no thresholding, rejection, binary sampling or chosen examples. It cannot
establish coverage of the known factors or aggregate Gaussian matching.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/aae_prior.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
